<title>USA: TABLE - Movie Gallery Inc Q2 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Movie Gallery Inc Q2 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>DOTHAN, Ala. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Jul 6,   Jun 30,    Jul 6,   Jun 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	 1996	1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  $ 61,328  $ 60,305  $127,006  $122,805</p>
<p> EBITDA (1)		   3,066     3,173     9,851     9,277</p>
<p> Net income (loss)(2)   (1,203)   (2,762)	 793     2,398</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>    per share (2)	  (0.09)    (0.21)	0.06	0.18</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding     13,420    13,469    13,420    13,288</p>
<p>NOTES:  (1) Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization, after deducting purchases of videocassette rental inventory. Purchases include inventory purchases specifically for new store openings.</p>
<p>(2) Results for 1996 include the effect of a one-time, non-cash, pre-tax charge of about $7.7 million, or $0.36 per share after tax, related to a change in amortization policy for videocassette rental inventory.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
